<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόφᾰσις</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόφημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>denial,
				negation,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάφασις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				263e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐστιν ἀπόφανσίς τινος ἀπό
				τινος</span>
			<i>a predication</i> of one thing <i>away from</i> another, i.e.
				<i>negation</i> of it, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Int.</u>
				17a25
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>APo.</u>
				72a14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινός</span>
			<i>negation, exclusion</i> of a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				426d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο ἀ.</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίαν κατάφασιν ἀποτελοῦσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Gall.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>negative particle,</i> e.g. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				124.8
			</span></i>, al.; <i>sign of negation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				2.52
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
